   "prompt": "count_words(text) should return a dict mapping each lowercase word to how many times it occurs. Words are separated by any whitespace and there must be no empty-string key. It returns wrong results. Find the error, fix the code and explain.",
   "function": "count_words",
   "broken_code": "def count_words(text):\n    counts = {}\n    for word in text.split(\" \"):\n        counts[word] = counts.get(word, 0) + 1\n    return counts\n",
